{"step_index":168,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T01:17:33Z","thinking":"Prepare to format the data into CSV (comma-separated values) as requested. Prioritize adding a header row to improve readability when opening or viewing the CSV file. Construct the CSV with the following header columns: `담당자,상태,상호명,사업자등록번호,대표자명,우편번호,주소,전화번호,팩스번호,홈페이지,이메일,종업원수,업종_`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Generate headered CSV file for user\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nconst srcTsv = 'c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/bizno_filtered_result.tsv';\\nconst destCsv = 'c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/bizno_filtered_result.csv';\\n\\nconst header = [\\n  '담당자',\\n  '상태',\\n  '상호명',\\n  '사업자등록번호',\\n  '대표자명',\\n  '우편번호',\\n  '회사주소',\\n  '전화번호',\\n  '팩스번호',\\n  '홈페이지',\\n  '회사이메일',\\n  '종업원수',\\n  '업종_종목',\\n  '법인등록번호',\\n  '결산월',\\n  '대분류',\\n  '중분류',\\n  '소분류_비즈인포산업명'\\n];\\n\\nconst content = fs.readFileSync(srcTsv, 'utf8');\\nconst lines = content.split('\\\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\\n\\nfunction escapeCsvCol(val) {\\n  if (val === null || val === undefined) val = '';\\n  val = String(val).trim();\\n  if (val.includes(',') || val.includes('\\\"') || val.includes('\\\\n') || val.includes('\\\\r')) {\\n    return '\\\"' + val.replace(/\\\"/g, '\\\"\\\"') + '\\\"';\\n  }\\n  return val;\\n}\\n\\nconst csvRows = [];\\ncsvRows.push(header.map(escapeCsvCol).join(','));\\n\\nlines.forEach(line => {\\n  const cols = line.split('\\\\t');\\n  while (cols.length < 18) cols.push('');\\n  csvRows.push(cols.map(escapeCsvCol).join(','));\\n});\\n\\n// Write with UTF-8 BOM for Excel compatibility\\nfs.writeFileSync(destCsv, '\\\\uFEFF' + csvRows.join('\\\\r\\\\n'), 'utf8');\\n\\nconsole.log(`Saved ${csvRows.length} rows (including header) to ${destCsv}`);\\n\"","Description":"\"Generate CSV with headers script\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\fc47ed12-b523-4d84-9421-40e6756ddcef\\\\scratch\\\\generate_csv.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing CSV generation script\"","toolSummary":"\"Create CSV generation script\""}}]}
